1
00:00:00,398 --> 00:00:04,045
Ever booked a badminton court,
and ended up one player short?

2
00:00:04,514 --> 00:00:08,388
Or posted in three group chats,
and got two maybes and a thumbs up?

3
00:00:09,186 --> 00:00:10,607
Meet Let's Sport!

4
00:00:11,076 --> 00:00:14,343
It brings your neighbours together
for badminton and basketball.

5
00:00:14,826 --> 00:00:16,562
Signing up takes ten seconds…

6
00:00:16,612 --> 00:00:18,426
and yes, there's confetti.

7
00:00:19,226 --> 00:00:20,968
Here's what's happening near you.

8
00:00:21,449 --> 00:00:23,661
Every card shows the date, the venue,

9
00:00:23,711 --> 00:00:26,311
the skill level,
and how many spots are left.

10
00:00:26,783 --> 00:00:28,323
Only into basketball?

11
00:00:28,795 --> 00:00:29,907
One tap.

12
00:00:30,709 --> 00:00:32,392
Want to start your own game?

13
00:00:32,861 --> 00:00:35,454
Pick a sport, give it
a name, set the time,

14
00:00:35,504 --> 00:00:39,342
and drop a Google Maps pin,
so nobody ends up at the wrong court.

15
00:00:40,144 --> 00:00:43,398
Hit post, and your game is live
for the whole neighbourhood.

16
00:00:44,207 --> 00:00:45,830
Spotted a game you like?

17
00:00:46,299 --> 00:00:48,471
Tap "I'm in", and you're on the team.

18
00:00:48,942 --> 00:00:50,257
Plans change?

19
00:00:50,728 --> 00:00:53,304
One tap frees your spot for someone else.

20
00:00:54,103 --> 00:00:57,929
On game day, open the map,
and get directions right to the court.

21
00:00:58,726 --> 00:01:01,164
Badminton, basketball, and good company,

22
00:01:01,214 --> 00:01:02,540
all in one place.

23
00:01:03,021 --> 00:01:05,566
Sign up today, host your
first game this week…

24
00:01:05,616 --> 00:01:06,799
and let's sport!
